retained suite requires 13 stable-ID units and 550 assertions. The new \
Chapter 7 supplemental unit runs separately. Historical v5 native results do \
not certify these v6 wrappers. Save this notebook after evaluation. Results \
are written into mathematica/chapters/verification_results_v6.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9615894e-2eb8-4d78-a931-001a2bd2fffa"],

